From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lkshrk <dev@harke.me>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 04:49:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] Close remaining user-scope secret paths

Resolving adapters (Hermes, Windsurf, Gemini, Antigravity) no longer look
up or inject a GitHub token at user scope. A Codex server refused while
rendering an ownership baseline now fails on its own instead of aborting
the MCP install. Codex stringifies non-string env literals at user scope
and refuses shell-default references such as ${V:-x}. Claude keeps
manifest env literals at user scope; references stay references.
---
 src/apm_cli/adapters/client/base.py           |   4 +-
 src/apm_cli/adapters/client/claude.py         |   4 +
 src/apm_cli/adapters/client/codex.py          |   9 +-
 src/apm_cli/adapters/client/copilot.py        |   5 +-
 src/apm_cli/install/mcp/ownership.py          |  17 ++-
 .../integration/mcp_integrator_install.py     |  12 +-
 .../test_user_scope_env_references.py         | 104 ++++++++++++++++++
 7 files changed, 143 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

